  * Implement VlanLayet::computeCalculateFields() to calculate
    the next EtherType
  * Parse the 802.1ad QinQ EtherType as VlanLayer
  * Replace c-style string copy (sprintf) with cpp-style string
    copy using sstreams
  * Tons of bug fixes

